{"seq":4,"slug":"video-segmentation","title":"视频分割","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/segmentation/video-segmentation","wordCount":1543,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"视频分割\">视频分割</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>视频分割将图像分割扩展到时间维度，要求模型在视频的连续帧之间保持分割结果的时序一致性。视频分割不仅需要精确的空间分割能力，还需要跨帧追踪和关联实例的能力，使得同一物体在不同帧中保持一致的标识。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[视频帧序列] --&gt; B{分割范式}&#10;    B --&gt; C[半监督 VOS]&#10;    B --&gt; D[视频实例分割]&#10;    B --&gt; E[视频全景分割]&#10;    C --&gt; F[首帧标注追踪]&#10;    D --&gt; G[逐帧检测+关联]&#10;    E --&gt; H[全场景时序理解]&#10;    F --&gt; I[时序一致分割]&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; I\">graph LR\n    A[视频帧序列] --&gt; B{分割范式}\n    B --&gt; C[半监督 VOS]\n    B --&gt; D[视频实例分割]\n    B --&gt; E[视频全景分割]\n    C --&gt; F[首帧标注追踪]\n    D --&gt; G[逐帧检测+关联]\n    E --&gt; H[全场景时序理解]\n    F --&gt; I[时序一致分割]\n    G --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; I</pre><p>视频分割面临的核心挑战包括：物体外观变化（光照、姿态、遮挡）、目标遮挡和重现、快速运动导致的模糊、场景中新物体的出现和消失。这些问题使得简单地逐帧应用图像分割模型效果不佳——帧间的不一致性会导致闪烁和跳变。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>任务类型</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>核心挑战</th>\n<th>代表方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>半监督 VOS</td>\n<td>首帧掩码</td>\n<td>全视频掩码</td>\n<td>外观变化追踪</td>\n<td>STM, XMem, SAM 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无监督 VOS</td>\n<td>仅视频</td>\n<td>主要物体掩码</td>\n<td>显著性物体发现</td>\n<td>MATNet, AMD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>视频实例分割</td>\n<td>仅视频</td>\n<td>实例轨迹+掩码</td>\n<td>检测+关联</td>\n<td>VITA, GenVIS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>视频全景分割</td>\n<td>仅视频</td>\n<td>全场景时序理解</td>\n<td>全类别时序一致</td>\n<td>Video-K-Net</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"半监督视频目标分割\">半监督视频目标分割</h2><p>半监督视频目标分割（Semi-supervised VOS）在第一帧提供目标的掩码标注，模型需要在后续所有帧中持续追踪和分割这些目标。这是视频分割中研究最成熟、应用最广泛的子任务。</p>\n<p>基于记忆的方法是当前最主流的 VOS 范式。STM（Space-Time Memory Networks）构建了一个记忆库，将已处理帧的特征和掩码存入记忆，查询帧通过与记忆的注意力匹配来获取分割信息。XMem 在 STM 基础上引入了多层级记忆架构（工作记忆、长期记忆、感觉记忆），有效处理长视频中的记忆管理问题。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class MemoryBank:&#10;    def __init__(self, max_size=50):&#10;        self.max_size = max_size&#10;        self.keys = []&#10;        self.values = []&#10;&#10;    def add(self, key, value):&#10;        self.keys.append(key)&#10;        self.values.append(value)&#10;        if len(self.keys) &gt; self.max_size:&#10;            self.keys.pop(1)&#10;            self.values.pop(1)&#10;&#10;    def read(self, query):&#10;        if not self.keys:&#10;            return None&#10;        keys = torch.cat(self.keys, dim=2)&#10;        values = torch.cat(self.values, dim=2)&#10;        affinity = torch.bmm(query.transpose(1, 2), keys)&#10;        affinity = torch.softmax(affinity, dim=2)&#10;        return torch.bmm(values, affinity.transpose(1, 2))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MemoryBank</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, max_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.max_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_size</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.keys </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.values </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, key, value):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.keys.append(key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.values.append(value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.keys) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.max_size:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.keys.pop(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.values.pop(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> read</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, query):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.keys:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        keys </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.cat(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.keys, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        values </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.cat(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.values, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        affinity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.bmm(query.transpose(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), keys)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        affinity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.softmax(affinity, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.bmm(values, affinity.transpose(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 记忆机制&#10;        A[第1帧 + 掩码] --&gt; B[记忆编码]&#10;        B --&gt; C[记忆库]&#10;        D[当前帧] --&gt; E[查询编码]&#10;        E --&gt; F[记忆读取]&#10;        C --&gt; F&#10;        F --&gt; G[掩码解码]&#10;        G --&gt; H[当前帧掩码]&#10;        H --&gt; I[更新记忆]&#10;        I --&gt; C&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph 记忆机制\n        A[第1帧 + 掩码] --&gt; B[记忆编码]\n        B --&gt; C[记忆库]\n        D[当前帧] --&gt; E[查询编码]\n        E --&gt; F[记忆读取]\n        C --&gt; F\n        F --&gt; G[掩码解码]\n        G --&gt; H[当前帧掩码]\n        H --&gt; I[更新记忆]\n        I --&gt; C\n    end</pre><p>Cutie 是当前 VOS 领域的前沿方法，它引入了目标级别的记忆表示，为每个追踪目标维护独立的记忆 token。这种设计使得模型能够更好地处理多目标场景中的遮挡和交互问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sam-2-与交互式视频分割\">SAM 2 与交互式视频分割</h2><p>SAM 2（Segment Anything Model 2）将 SAM 的交互式分割能力从图像扩展到视频。用户可以在视频的任意帧上通过点击、框选或文本提示标注目标，SAM 2 自动将分割结果传播到整个视频序列。</p>\n<p>SAM 2 的架构包含三个核心组件：图像编码器（Hiera，一种层级化的 ViT）、记忆模块（记忆编码器 + 记忆注意力 + 记忆库）和掩码解码器。图像编码器生成每帧的视觉特征，记忆模块维护时序上下文信息，掩码解码器结合当前帧特征和记忆信息生成分割掩码。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from sam2.build_sam import build_sam2_video_predictor&#10;import torch&#10;&#10;predictor = build_sam2_video_predictor(&quot;sam2_hiera_large.yaml&quot;, &quot;sam2_hiera_large.pt&quot;)&#10;&#10;with torch.inference_mode():&#10;    state = predictor.init_state(video_path=&quot;video.mp4&quot;)&#10;&#10;    predictor.add_new_points_or_box(&#10;        inference_state=state,&#10;        frame_idx=0,&#10;        obj_id=1,&#10;        points=[[200, 300]],&#10;        labels=[1],&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    for frame_idx, obj_ids, masks in predictor.propagate_in_video(state):&#10;        for obj_id, mask in zip(obj_ids, masks):&#10;            print(f&quot;帧 {frame_idx}, 目标 {obj_id}: {mask.shape}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sam2.build_sam </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> build_sam2_video_predictor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">predictor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> build_sam2_video_predictor(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sam2_hiera_large.yaml\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sam2_hiera_large.pt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.inference_mode():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> predictor.init_state(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">video_path</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"video.mp4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    predictor.add_new_points_or_box(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        inference_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">state,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        frame_idx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        obj_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        points</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">300</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        labels</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> frame_idx, obj_ids, masks </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> predictor.propagate_in_video(state):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> obj_id, mask </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> zip</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(obj_ids, masks):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"帧 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">frame_idx</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, 目标 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">obj_id</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mask.shape</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>SAM 2 的记忆注意力机制使得当前帧的特征能够同时关注近期帧（短期记忆）和关键帧（长期记忆）的信息。当用户在后续帧上提供修正提示时，模型可以双向传播修正结果，提升整个视频的分割质量。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>SAM (图像)</th>\n<th>SAM 2 (视频)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>图像分割</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>支持（更快）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>视频追踪</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交互修正</td>\n<td>单帧</td>\n<td>多帧传播</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多目标</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>支持+时序一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实时性</td>\n<td>较慢</td>\n<td>优化（Hiera）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"sam-3-与概念提示分割\">SAM 3 与概念提示分割</h2><p>2025 年 11 月，Meta 发布 SAM 3（arXiv:2511.16719），把可提示分割的提示类型从点、框扩展到「概念提示」（concept prompts）——名词短语（如 yellow school bus）、图像示例，或两者的组合。其核心任务 Promptable Concept Segmentation（PCS）接收一个概念提示，在图像和视频中检测、分割并追踪所有匹配该概念的实例，并为每个实例赋予唯一 ID。这使 SAM 系列的能力从「交互式地分割用户点选的对象」跃迁为「按语义概念分割一切」，图像分割与视频多实例追踪在同一个统一模型中完成。</p>\n<p>对工程实践的影响是直接的：此前需要「检测 + 分割 + 关联」三个模块拼接的开放集视频实例分割流程，现在可以用一个 PCS 模型端到端替代；SAM 2 的交互式传播则继续适用于无类别语义的用户指定目标追踪。</p>\n<h2 id=\"视频实例分割\">视频实例分割</h2><p>视频实例分割（Video Instance Segmentation, VIS）要求模型在整个视频中检测、分割和追踪所有实例。与半监督 VOS 不同，VIS 不需要首帧标注，模型需要自动发现和追踪所有感兴趣的实例。</p>\n<p>在线方法（如 MinVIS）逐帧运行实例分割，然后通过关联算法将帧间的实例匹配起来。关联策略通常基于实例嵌入的相似度、空间位置的一致性和掩码的 IoU。离线方法（如 VITA）将整个视频作为输入，通过时序注意力直接建模跨帧关系。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class TrackAssociation:&#10;    def __init__(self, threshold=0.5):&#10;        self.threshold = threshold&#10;        self.tracks = {}&#10;        self.next_id = 0&#10;&#10;    def update(self, embeddings, masks, scores):&#10;        if not self.tracks:&#10;            for i in range(len(embeddings)):&#10;                self.tracks[self.next_id] = {&#10;                    &#39;embedding&#39;: embeddings[i],&#10;                    &#39;mask&#39;: masks[i],&#10;                }&#10;                self.next_id += 1&#10;            return list(range(self.next_id))&#10;&#10;        track_embs = torch.stack([t[&#39;embedding&#39;] for t in self.tracks.values()])&#10;        similarity = torch.mm(embeddings, track_embs.T)&#10;&#10;        assignments = []&#10;        for i in range(len(embeddings)):&#10;            max_sim, max_idx = similarity[i].max(0)&#10;            track_id = list(self.tracks.keys())[max_idx]&#10;            if max_sim &gt; self.threshold:&#10;                assignments.append(track_id)&#10;                self.tracks[track_id][&#39;embedding&#39;] = embeddings[i]&#10;            else:&#10;                assignments.append(self.next_id)&#10;                self.tracks[self.next_id] = {&#39;embedding&#39;: embeddings[i], &#39;mask&#39;: masks[i]}&#10;                self.next_id += 1&#10;        return assignments\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TrackAssociation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, threshold</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.threshold </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> threshold</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.tracks </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span